  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "framed_step_correspondence is an iff over arbitrary classes, callable tables, before and after. The RHS existentially supplies a Shared framed successor and exact equality of the Functions endpoint to embedFramed successor. embedFramed preserves heap/counter, maps a live frame to one no-result/no-destination frame and absent frame to empty stack. Collection commutes without WF assumptions. Thus both local statements and initial exit match exactly; no additional exit alternative remains. The machine/gc/steps units introduce the lifetime notation; inherited syntax, storage and typing notation remain in the listed dependency units. Functions keeps its explicit inherited-machinery forward reference to the appendix.",
  "limitations": [
    "Author self-review, not independent review.",
    "Abstract syntax formalization, not a parser or elaborator.",
    "GC is a noncomputable mathematical reachability filter. General Functions call-stack safety remains a separate draft."
  ],
